details in the 3rd newsletter.]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p class=""><span class="sqsrte-text-color--accent">Recently, project 22NRM05 - MeLiDos reached its midpoint. This is an occasion to review what has been achieved so far through our several newsletters, in particular our newly released 3rd edition. Please check out a summary below and find the complete newsletters </span><a href="https://www.melidos.eu/materials" target=""><span class="sqsrte-text-color--accent">here</span></a><span class="sqsrte-text-color--accent">.</span></p>


  






  














































  

    
  
    

      

      
